WEBVTT

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:06.871
Captain's Log, Stardate 50063.2.

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:09.670
We've accepted an invitation
from the Nechani

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:12.269
to take a few days' shore leave
on their world.

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:14.114
We're enjoying the opportunity
to learn about their culture.

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:15.877
We're enjoying the opportunity
to learn about their culture.

00:00:15.915 --> 00:00:20.409
This sanctuary honors
our Ancestral Spirits.

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:24.082
Their presence
is very strong here.

00:00:38.638 --> 00:00:41.630
Those are brothers
of the Nechisti Order.

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:45.576
They've devoted their lives
to serving the Spirits.

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:48.240
Here's something
you might find interesting.

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:55.850
What do you think this means?

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:57.413
Hard to tell.

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:59.425
A fertility symbol, maybe?

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:02.485
Or a blessing
for good luck or wisdom.

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:04.793
Or happiness and love.

00:01:06.199 --> 00:01:07.666
Do you hear something?

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:08.689
What?

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:28.849
Look at that.
It's beautiful.

00:01:28.888 --> 00:01:30.651
It looks like a shrine.

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:38.793
Come on, sweeting,
we don't want to be left behind.

00:01:38.831 --> 00:01:40.492
I just want to take
a quick look.

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:51.209
Kes!

00:01:53.846 --> 00:01:55.006
Kes.

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:56.675
Can you hear me?

00:01:56.716 --> 00:01:58.843
Help!

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:00.113
Somebody!

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:01.620
We need help!

00:03:52.497 --> 00:03:53.521
What happened?

00:03:53.565 --> 00:03:54.964
Oh, you mustn't be here.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.092
This shrine is protected.

00:03:56.134 --> 00:03:57.726
She didn't touch anything.

00:03:57.769 --> 00:03:59.327
She went as far as that archway

00:03:59.371 --> 00:04:01.202
and then an energy field
knocked her down.

00:04:01.239 --> 00:04:02.206
Torres to Voyager.

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:03.366
We have a medical emergency.

00:04:03.408 --> 00:04:05.137
Beam Kes and Neelix
directly to Sick Bay.

00:04:05.177 --> 00:04:06.303
Yes, Lieutenant.

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:12.870
Oh, this is most unfortunate.

00:04:12.915 --> 00:04:15.247
Please, I must ask you
to leave as well.

00:04:15.284 --> 00:04:16.251
We aren't going anywhere

00:04:16.285 --> 00:04:17.809
until we find out
what happened to her.

00:04:17.853 --> 00:04:20.617
What kind of energy
was she exposed to?

00:04:20.656 --> 00:04:22.385
I-I-I have no idea.

00:04:22.424 --> 00:04:23.516
This is a sacred place.

00:04:23.559 --> 00:04:25.959
Only the monks truly understand
what happens here.

00:04:26.061 --> 00:04:27.961
Then we'll bring
scanning equipment down

00:04:28.063 --> 00:04:29.530
and investigate for ourselves.

00:04:29.565 --> 00:04:30.532
That's out of the question.

00:04:30.566 --> 00:04:31.897
It would show disrespect
to the Spirits.

00:04:31.934 --> 00:04:34.095
One of our crew has
been critically injured.

00:04:34.136 --> 00:04:36.604
We aren't going to stand
by and do nothing.

00:04:36.639 --> 00:04:37.628
There's nothing you can do.

00:04:37.673 --> 00:04:39.231
She's been punished
by the Spirits.

00:04:39.275 --> 00:04:40.242
She's going to die.

00:04:40.276 --> 00:04:42.836
If you prevent us
from helping Kes,

00:04:42.878 --> 00:04:45.176
we will hold you
directly responsible

00:04:45.214 --> 00:04:46.841
for anything
that happens to her.

00:04:46.882 --> 00:04:49.817
I will make a full report
to our Captain.

00:04:49.852 --> 00:04:51.444
I'm sure you'll be hearing
from her.

00:04:51.487 --> 00:04:52.886
I'll be happy to talk to her

00:04:52.921 --> 00:04:54.582
and to do
whatever I can to help,

00:04:54.623 --> 00:04:55.749
but your presence here

00:04:55.791 --> 00:04:57.725
only makes
a delicate situation worse.

00:04:57.760 --> 00:05:00.024
Please, leave now.

00:05:06.302 --> 00:05:09.169
Her life signs are
very weak but stable.

00:05:09.204 --> 00:05:10.694
It appears
that her synaptic pathways

00:05:10.739 --> 00:05:12.604
have undergone
a severe neuroleptic shock,

00:05:12.641 --> 00:05:14.404
which is disrupting
all cortical functions.

00:05:14.443 --> 00:05:17.071
It is similar
to a comatose state,

00:05:17.112 --> 00:05:19.103
but with none of the usual
biochemical markers.

00:05:19.148 --> 00:05:20.877
You can cure her, can't you?

00:05:20.916 --> 00:05:22.315
I can't even speculate
on a treatment

00:05:22.351 --> 00:05:24.319
until I know more about
what caused her condition.

00:05:24.353 --> 00:05:25.513
We're working on that.

00:05:25.554 --> 00:05:27.818
We aren't allowed near the area
where the accident occurred,

00:05:27.856 --> 00:05:30.086
but Kim and Torres are scanning
the sanctuary from Voyager.

00:05:30.125 --> 00:05:31.285
They'll report their findings

00:05:31.327 --> 00:05:34.387
to you and I have an appointment
to talk to the magistrate.

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:35.397
I'm hoping he'll be able

00:05:35.431 --> 00:05:36.762
to cut through some
of the restrictions

00:05:36.799 --> 00:05:37.766
the monks have set up.

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:40.291
Excuse me, Captain...

00:05:40.336 --> 00:05:42.827
I'd like to do something
to help.

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:46.607
The Nechani must have records.

00:05:46.642 --> 00:05:49.133
Some kind of scientific data
on this energy field.

00:05:49.178 --> 00:05:51.840
Go down to the planet
and see what you can find.

00:05:54.783 --> 00:05:56.512
I'll be back soon.

00:06:00.022 --> 00:06:01.489
Please understand, Captain,

00:06:01.523 --> 00:06:03.889
I'm caught in a most
difficult situation.

00:06:03.926 --> 00:06:05.257
I'm an official
of the government

00:06:05.294 --> 00:06:06.693
not a spiritual leader.

00:06:06.729 --> 00:06:09.664
I don't pretend to understand
why the Spirits do what they do.

00:06:09.698 --> 00:06:11.689
Then perhaps I could
talk with the brothers.

00:06:11.734 --> 00:06:14.032
I've asked the Nechisti Council
to give you an audience,

00:06:14.069 --> 00:06:16.936
but I'm afraid they consider
the matter closed.

00:06:17.039 --> 00:06:21.032
They've asked me to express
their sympathies for your loss.

00:06:21.076 --> 00:06:23.169
There is no loss at this point.

00:06:23.212 --> 00:06:24.839
Kes is still alive.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.905
Surely, there's some way
to treat her.

00:06:26.949 --> 00:06:29.474
Can't you insist that the monks
meet with me?

00:06:29.518 --> 00:06:31.315
We have an agreement
with the Council.

00:06:31.353 --> 00:06:33.548
They don't involve themselves
with government

00:06:33.589 --> 00:06:36.149
and we don't interfere
in their spiritual matters.

00:06:36.191 --> 00:06:38.523
It's been that way for centuries
and it's always

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:39.527
worked well for us.

00:06:39.561 --> 00:06:41.324
Then can you tell me
what you do know

00:06:41.363 --> 00:06:43.490
about the sanctuary
and what happens there?

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:46.360
I'll try.

00:06:48.537 --> 00:06:51.438
That particular shrine
is where the monks go

00:06:51.473 --> 00:06:53.941
to receive the gift
of purification...

00:06:53.976 --> 00:06:55.068
cleansing of the soul.

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:56.839
It is one of our
most holy places.

00:06:56.879 --> 00:06:59.245
You mean the monks can enter it
without being harmed?

00:06:59.281 --> 00:07:01.681
They prepare themselves
with a sacred ritual

00:07:01.717 --> 00:07:04.686
during which they speak directly
with the Ancestral Spirits.

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:07.280
After that, they are able
to enter the shrine safely.

00:07:07.322 --> 00:07:08.516
What happens in that ritual?

00:07:08.557 --> 00:07:10.650
How does it offer protection
against the energy field?

00:07:10.692 --> 00:07:13.593
Captain, you seem to want
explanations for everything.

00:07:13.629 --> 00:07:14.721
I don't have them.

00:07:14.763 --> 00:07:16.697
Only the brothers who've
gone through the ritual

00:07:16.732 --> 00:07:20.327
know what happens there,
and they're sworn to secrecy.

00:07:21.837 --> 00:07:24.101
The energy field
that Kes encountered...

00:07:24.139 --> 00:07:25.572
is there anyone
who could give me

00:07:25.607 --> 00:07:27.939
scientific information
that would help us analyze it?

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:31.776
All we know is that it is a
naturally occurring phenomenon.

00:07:31.814 --> 00:07:34.282
If you're telling me...

00:07:34.316 --> 00:07:37.547
that there's nothing
you can do to help Kes,

00:07:37.586 --> 00:07:39.076
I simply won't accept that.

00:07:39.121 --> 00:07:41.089
If I could help you, I would.

00:07:41.123 --> 00:07:42.317
I swear it.

00:07:44.359 --> 00:07:46.486
I blame myself.

00:07:46.528 --> 00:07:47.961
If I'd watched more carefully,

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:50.157
seen that she was approaching
the shrine...

00:07:52.267 --> 00:07:54.735
There's nothing more
to be done now.

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:57.500
You have our sympathy.

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:06.438
Have Kim and Torres
given you a report?

00:08:06.482 --> 00:08:09.007
Yes. I received
a fascinating lesson

00:08:09.051 --> 00:08:11.212
in the challenges of getting
clear scanner readings

00:08:11.253 --> 00:08:12.811
through solid rock.

00:08:12.855 --> 00:08:15.221
We were eventually able
to distinguish

00:08:15.257 --> 00:08:18.124
an intense biogenic field
at the site of Kes's accident.

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:20.924
That would certainly explain
the neuroleptic shock.

00:08:20.996 --> 00:08:22.930
She was lucky not to have
been killed instantly.

00:08:22.998 --> 00:08:24.693
As I understand it,
the Nechani monks

00:08:24.733 --> 00:08:27.224
are able to enter the field
without being harmed at all.

00:08:27.269 --> 00:08:30.033
Really? I don't expect
they'd care to tell us how?

00:08:30.072 --> 00:08:31.539
No, they wouldn't.

00:08:40.282 --> 00:08:42.750
She's not responding
to conventional treatments

00:08:42.784 --> 00:08:45.378
and frankly, I'm running out
of unconventional ideas as well.

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:47.479
The level of activity
in her brain is so low,

00:08:47.523 --> 00:08:49.047
I can't rule out the possibility

00:08:49.091 --> 00:08:51.423
of permanent damage,
even if I can revive her.

00:08:52.561 --> 00:08:54.392
The longer she stays
in this condition,

00:08:54.429 --> 00:08:57.364
the less likely it is
she'll ever recover.

00:09:03.839 --> 00:09:05.500
How is she?

00:09:05.541 --> 00:09:08.066
I'm afraid there's
been no change.

00:09:10.245 --> 00:09:12.907
I've researched
everything I could find

00:09:12.981 --> 00:09:14.676
about the sacred shrine.

00:09:14.716 --> 00:09:17.879
I didn't uncover
much scientific evidence,

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:19.888
but there was one story...

00:09:19.922 --> 00:09:23.790
it was in a very old text,
I'm not sure how reliable...

00:09:23.825 --> 00:09:26.419
about a boy who recovered
from a condition like Kes's.

00:09:26.461 --> 00:09:28.691
He was a young prince.

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:31.130
He wandered into
the shrine accidentally

00:09:31.166 --> 00:09:32.929
and he went into a death sleep.

00:09:33.035 --> 00:09:36.061
Everyone said it was
the will of the Spirits.

00:09:36.104 --> 00:09:41.132
His father, King Nevad,
refused to accept that,

00:09:41.176 --> 00:09:42.803
so he went through the ritual

00:09:42.844 --> 00:09:45.574
to seek an audience
with the Spirits

00:09:45.614 --> 00:09:48.048
and he pleaded
for his son's life.

00:09:48.083 --> 00:09:50.881
The Spirits,
in their infinite mercy,

00:09:50.919 --> 00:09:52.511
granted his request.

00:09:52.554 --> 00:09:55.182
That was the only trace of hope
that I could find.

00:09:58.694 --> 00:10:00.685
Maybe it's enough.

00:10:00.729 --> 00:10:03.630
Well, you've certainly done
your research, Captain.

00:10:03.665 --> 00:10:05.132
I'm familiar with the story.

00:10:05.167 --> 00:10:06.327
I heard it as a child.

00:10:06.368 --> 00:10:08.700
It suggests that there's
still a chance for Kes.

00:10:08.737 --> 00:10:11.137
You're talking
about a very specific case.

00:10:11.173 --> 00:10:14.074
Nevad was able to claim
responsibility for the prince,

00:10:14.109 --> 00:10:16.373
as a father and as a king.

00:10:16.411 --> 00:10:19.209
That's why the Spirits
were willing to listen to him.

00:10:19.247 --> 00:10:20.646
The Captain of a starship

00:10:20.682 --> 00:10:24.015
is fully responsible
for every member of her crew.

00:10:25.354 --> 00:10:26.981
So she is.

00:10:27.022 --> 00:10:28.990
Then on that basis,

00:10:29.057 --> 00:10:31.924
I'd like to go through
the ritual myself.

00:10:39.434 --> 00:10:41.561
I haven't heard
from the magistrate yet,

00:10:41.603 --> 00:10:43.400
but he seemed to think
there was a strong possibility

00:10:43.438 --> 00:10:45.531
the monks would let me
go through the ritual.

00:10:45.574 --> 00:10:46.871
Captain, forgive me,

00:10:46.908 --> 00:10:49.706
but you've never been
one to put much trust

00:10:49.745 --> 00:10:51.542
in religious ceremonies.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:53.775
Exactly what is it
you hope to accomplish?

00:10:53.815 --> 00:10:55.407
If you're asking
whether I expect to speak

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:57.782
to the Ancestral Spirits...
no, of course not.

00:10:57.819 --> 00:10:59.650
But something happens
to the monks

00:10:59.688 --> 00:11:01.451
when they go through the ritual,

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:03.822
something that allows them
to withstand the effects

00:11:03.859 --> 00:11:04.883
of the biogenic field.

00:11:04.926 --> 00:11:06.325
I want to find out what that is.

00:11:06.361 --> 00:11:08.261
It might provide clues
to a treatment.

00:11:08.296 --> 00:11:10.287
Some kind of physiological
change, maybe.

00:11:10.332 --> 00:11:11.697
That's what I'm guessing.

00:11:11.733 --> 00:11:14.827
The shamans of the Karis Tribe
on Delios Vll practice a ritual

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:17.634
that increases the electrical
resistance of their skin.

00:11:17.673 --> 00:11:18.935
It protects them

00:11:18.974 --> 00:11:21.340
from plasma discharges
in their sacred caves.

00:11:21.376 --> 00:11:24.436
Something similar must happen
during this ritual.

00:11:24.479 --> 00:11:26.379
We'll have to find a way
to allow the Doctor

00:11:26.415 --> 00:11:27.905
to monitor
your physical condition

00:11:27.949 --> 00:11:30.850
and you should have a way to
call for an emergency beam-out

00:11:30.886 --> 00:11:33.150
if you need it, as a precaution.

00:11:33.188 --> 00:11:35.713
We don't have any idea
what the ritual entails.

00:11:35.757 --> 00:11:38.783
I've been reviewing the
Federation's cultural database.

00:11:38.827 --> 00:11:40.988
Most traditional
spirit quest ceremonies

00:11:41.096 --> 00:11:43.087
involve some kind
of physical challenge

00:11:43.131 --> 00:11:44.393
or a test of endurance...

00:11:44.433 --> 00:11:47.300
to prove the mastery
of spirit over body.

00:11:47.335 --> 00:11:49.997
My instinct tells me
this one will be similar.

00:11:50.105 --> 00:11:53.233
A series of ordeals that will
result in biochemical changes.

00:11:53.275 --> 00:11:55.937
Of course, there's always
the possibility

00:11:55.977 --> 00:11:58.537
that the Ancestral Spirits
really do control

00:11:58.580 --> 00:12:00.548
what happens in the shrine.

00:12:01.483 --> 00:12:03.348
To each his own, Commander.

00:12:03.385 --> 00:12:06.548
But I imagine if we
scratched deep enough,

00:12:06.588 --> 00:12:09.853
we'd find a scientific basis
for most religious doctrines.

00:12:09.891 --> 00:12:11.950
I remember when my mother
taught me about the science

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:13.925
underlying the vision quest.

00:12:13.962 --> 00:12:16.487
In a way I felt... disappointed.

00:12:16.531 --> 00:12:18.328
Some of the mystery was gone.

00:12:18.366 --> 00:12:21.803
Maybe the Nechani have chosen
not to lose the mystery.

00:12:21.936 --> 00:12:23.164
Under other circumstances,

00:12:23.204 --> 00:12:25.968
I'd be more than happy
to go along with their choice.

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:28.634
Right now, it's killing
one of my crew.

00:12:28.676 --> 00:12:30.940
Bridge to the Captain.

00:12:30.978 --> 00:12:31.967
Janeway here.

00:12:32.046 --> 00:12:33.775
You have
an incoming transmission

00:12:33.815 --> 00:12:34.907
from the magistrate.

00:12:34.949 --> 00:12:37.816
Put it through
to Chakotay's office.

00:12:37.852 --> 00:12:39.012
Aye, Captain.

00:12:42.023 --> 00:12:43.650
I must congratulate you,
Captain.

00:12:43.691 --> 00:12:45.625
Your creative approach
to this problem

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.491
has fascinated
the Nechisti Council.

00:12:47.528 --> 00:12:49.155
Then they've approved
my request?

00:12:49.197 --> 00:12:50.323
Eagerly.

00:12:50.364 --> 00:12:52.594
They consider it an honor
that you want to seek

00:12:52.633 --> 00:12:53.827
the Spirits.

00:12:53.868 --> 00:12:56.894
The ritual traditionally
begins at sunset.

00:12:56.938 --> 00:12:59.873
A guide will meet you at
the entrance to the sanctuary.

00:12:59.907 --> 00:13:02.273
Thank you.
I appreciate your efforts.

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:07.145
I have been greatly troubled
by your misfortune, Captain.

00:13:07.181 --> 00:13:09.843
If you are able
to convince the Spirits

00:13:09.884 --> 00:13:14.014
to spare your friend,
no one would be happier than I.

00:13:20.228 --> 00:13:21.718
Everything seems to be working.

00:13:21.762 --> 00:13:24.356
The subdermal bioprobe
will transmit any changes

00:13:24.398 --> 00:13:25.695
in your biochemistry.

00:13:25.733 --> 00:13:28.896
And, Captain, the implant also
contains a homing beacon,

00:13:28.936 --> 00:13:30.130
which we'll be able to pick up

00:13:30.171 --> 00:13:31.968
no matter how far
into the sanctuary you go.

00:13:32.006 --> 00:13:33.564
Just tap it like a combadge

00:13:33.608 --> 00:13:35.337
and we'll transport
you immediately.

00:13:35.376 --> 00:13:36.604
Thank you both.

00:13:45.653 --> 00:13:47.450
I don't think
that will be necessary.

00:13:47.488 --> 00:13:49.149
It is standard procedure

00:13:49.190 --> 00:13:51.090
to carry arms
on an away mission,

00:13:51.125 --> 00:13:52.990
particularly when you
don't know what to expect.

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:55.824
This is strictly an
information-gathering mission.

00:13:55.863 --> 00:13:57.728
I don't want to appear hostile.

00:14:03.537 --> 00:14:04.868
Energize.

00:14:53.254 --> 00:14:54.949
I don't suppose
you know anything

00:14:54.989 --> 00:14:56.456
about chromodynamic lights?

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:58.685
No, not really.

00:14:58.726 --> 00:15:00.751
Oh...

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:05.765
I suppose I could look at it.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:07.597
They're as fussy
as Tarchee cats.

00:15:07.635 --> 00:15:09.159
You tune them too high,
they burn out.

00:15:09.203 --> 00:15:11.171
You tune them too low,
they sputter.

00:15:11.205 --> 00:15:12.433
I've told the monks

00:15:12.473 --> 00:15:14.668
to replace them all
with neodyne lights.

00:15:14.709 --> 00:15:16.233
It would save hours
of repair work.

00:15:16.277 --> 00:15:18.177
That device you've got,
what is that?

00:15:18.212 --> 00:15:19.907
It's called a tricorder.

00:15:19.947 --> 00:15:20.936
A tricor...

00:15:20.982 --> 00:15:23.246
What exactly does
a tricorder do?

00:15:23.284 --> 00:15:24.581
It's a scanning device.

00:15:24.618 --> 00:15:26.449
Interesting. May I?

00:15:26.487 --> 00:15:29.854
Oh. Atmospheric reading,
energy field analysis,

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:31.824
full technical database.

00:15:31.859 --> 00:15:34.623
This is certainly
a convenient thing to have.

00:15:34.662 --> 00:15:36.289
Oh, I didn't mean
for you to keep it.

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:37.820
I'll need that back.

00:15:37.865 --> 00:15:39.856
Ah...

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:40.992
No, you won't.

00:15:44.005 --> 00:15:46.098
You're my guide.

00:15:46.140 --> 00:15:47.835
Guide, advisor,
spiritual companion...

00:15:47.875 --> 00:15:50.366
whatever term you prefer
is fine with me.

00:15:50.411 --> 00:15:53.039
Well, why didn't you say
something earlier?

00:15:54.181 --> 00:15:56.240
Shall we get started?

00:16:17.238 --> 00:16:19.229
It's all right, Kathryn.

00:16:49.403 --> 00:16:52.065
Would it be breaking
any vows of secrecy now

00:16:52.106 --> 00:16:54.097
to tell me what this ritual
will involve?

00:16:54.141 --> 00:16:55.870
Why do you think I know?

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:58.276
Haven't you been through
this before?

00:16:58.312 --> 00:16:59.904
Don't worry.

00:16:59.947 --> 00:17:01.642
I'll help you find your way.

00:17:01.682 --> 00:17:03.206
Tell me...

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:05.081
have you completely
committed yourself

00:17:05.119 --> 00:17:06.609
to this journey?

00:17:06.654 --> 00:17:07.678
Yes.

00:17:07.721 --> 00:17:09.689
You're willing to go through

00:17:09.723 --> 00:17:11.452
what the monks have
been doing for centuries

00:17:11.492 --> 00:17:12.652
to help them find the Spirits?

00:17:12.693 --> 00:17:14.092
Yes.

00:17:14.128 --> 00:17:18.622
So you can send biochemical data
back to your ship?

00:17:18.666 --> 00:17:20.531
No, it wasn't magic.

00:17:20.568 --> 00:17:23.731
Our bio-scanners detected the
microprobe under your skin.

00:17:23.771 --> 00:17:25.830
I hope that won't be a problem.

00:17:25.873 --> 00:17:27.864
Makes no difference
at all.

00:17:27.908 --> 00:17:31.275
You are fond of your little
devices, aren't you?

00:17:31.312 --> 00:17:34.042
They've always served me well.

00:17:34.081 --> 00:17:35.946
I'm sure they have.

00:17:36.016 --> 00:17:38.382
Please, come this way.

00:17:51.899 --> 00:17:53.161
Who are you?

00:17:54.201 --> 00:17:55.793
I'm Kathryn Janeway.

00:17:55.836 --> 00:17:57.895
Is this where the ritual begins?

00:17:57.938 --> 00:18:00.429
Oh, the ritual... yes.

00:18:00.474 --> 00:18:01.998
We're waiting.

00:18:02.042 --> 00:18:04.033
Come, join us.

00:18:04.078 --> 00:18:06.911
What exactly
are you waiting for?

00:18:07.014 --> 00:18:09.915
Just... waiting.

00:18:11.352 --> 00:18:14.014
How long have you been
sitting here?

00:18:14.054 --> 00:18:16.352
Uh, how long has it been?

00:18:16.390 --> 00:18:18.051
Why are you asking me?!

00:18:18.092 --> 00:18:19.286
I've lost track!

00:18:19.326 --> 00:18:21.385
It's been a while.

00:18:21.428 --> 00:18:23.521
I know that.

00:18:23.564 --> 00:18:24.929
Oh, it's been...

00:18:25.032 --> 00:18:28.900
as long as we can remember.

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:38.105
Are you telling me
I have to wait a lifetime

00:18:38.145 --> 00:18:39.874
before I can go
through the ritual?

00:18:39.914 --> 00:18:42.280
I didn't hear anyone
say that, did you?

00:18:42.316 --> 00:18:46.047
Certainly not, all we said
was that we're waiting.

00:18:46.086 --> 00:18:48.850
I'm just trying to understand
how this works.

00:18:48.889 --> 00:18:51.517
The monks I saw in the sanctuary
were young.

00:18:51.559 --> 00:18:53.424
They couldn't have waited
such a long time

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:54.757
to go through their rituals.

00:18:54.795 --> 00:18:57.093
Now, she's right
about that, you know.

00:18:57.131 --> 00:18:58.928
She's a smart one.

00:18:58.966 --> 00:19:01.491
She thinks she is, at any rate.

00:19:01.535 --> 00:19:03.867
This is a test of some kind,
isn't it?

00:19:03.904 --> 00:19:05.895
To prove my determination.

00:19:06.006 --> 00:19:08.839
A test?
She thinks we're a test.

00:19:08.876 --> 00:19:10.810
What is she talking about?

00:19:10.844 --> 00:19:12.334
She must like tests.

00:19:12.379 --> 00:19:15.576
I suppose tests
make sense to her.

00:19:15.616 --> 00:19:18.483
Has anyone ever tried
to open this door?

00:19:18.519 --> 00:19:22.148
How many times
do we have to tell you

00:19:22.189 --> 00:19:24.089
that we are waiting?!

00:19:24.124 --> 00:19:28.458
My dear, why don't
you just sit down and relax?

00:19:28.495 --> 00:19:30.360
You're much too tense.

00:19:30.397 --> 00:19:32.888
You're welcome to wait with us.

00:19:32.933 --> 00:19:33.900
I don't want to wait.

00:19:33.934 --> 00:19:35.492
I have a friend
who's depending on me.

00:19:35.536 --> 00:19:36.901
I have to go through
the ritual.

00:19:36.937 --> 00:19:39.701
I wonder if she's
always this impatient!

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:41.640
Oh, she's just determined.

00:19:41.675 --> 00:19:44.075
She wants to get on with it.

00:19:44.111 --> 00:19:46.705
Seems to me,
she could be friendly

00:19:46.747 --> 00:19:48.738
and sit for a few minutes.

00:19:48.782 --> 00:19:51.478
No, no. She knows
what she wants to do.

00:19:51.518 --> 00:19:53.884
She's not the kind
to sit around

00:19:53.921 --> 00:19:56.446
when she has a mission
to accomplish.

00:20:01.829 --> 00:20:03.956
I told you.

00:20:04.064 --> 00:20:06.259
I told you it was locked.

00:20:15.209 --> 00:20:16.437
Yes?

00:20:18.245 --> 00:20:20.873
I mean no disrespect.

00:20:20.914 --> 00:20:24.111
But unless there's something
I'm supposed to accomplish here,

00:20:24.151 --> 00:20:26.820
I'd like to continue
with the ritual.

00:20:26.953 --> 00:20:28.420
By all means.

00:20:40.266 --> 00:20:42.632
I'm not sure how to begin.

00:20:42.669 --> 00:20:45.160
Do you want me to give
you orders, Captain?

00:20:45.205 --> 00:20:46.502
I'll do whatever
you ask of me.

00:20:46.539 --> 00:20:47.870
I see.

00:20:47.907 --> 00:20:49.238
So you think
that this is just a matter

00:20:49.275 --> 00:20:50.674
of doing what you're told.

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:53.338
No, I'm sure there is
spiritual significance

00:20:53.379 --> 00:20:55.347
behind the challenges
involved.

00:20:55.381 --> 00:20:58.179
Challenges?
That's what you expect.

00:20:58.218 --> 00:21:00.448
I don't have any idea
what to expect.

00:21:00.486 --> 00:21:03.148
I've studied a number
of ritualistic societies

00:21:03.189 --> 00:21:04.656
and many of the rites
have commonalities.

00:21:04.691 --> 00:21:06.818
This one may be
completely different.

00:21:06.860 --> 00:21:09.328
I'm willing to do
whatever is necessary.

00:21:09.362 --> 00:21:10.829
I don't doubt that.

00:21:10.864 --> 00:21:14.300
But do you realize that all
of this is meaningless?

00:21:14.334 --> 00:21:15.858
That the only thing that matters

00:21:15.902 --> 00:21:18.632
is finding your connection
to the Spirits?

00:21:18.671 --> 00:21:21.139
I'm going to make
every effort to do that,

00:21:21.174 --> 00:21:24.666
but I didn't come here
for personal enlightenment.

00:21:24.711 --> 00:21:27.271
I'm trying to save
a member of my crew.

00:21:27.313 --> 00:21:29.474
That's a worthy cause.

00:21:29.515 --> 00:21:31.676
I hope the Spirits
listen to you.

00:21:31.718 --> 00:21:33.811
Then let's begin.

00:21:36.089 --> 00:21:39.115
The first challenge.

00:21:39.158 --> 00:21:40.682
Stand like this.

00:21:43.029 --> 00:21:45.088
Hold that.

00:21:45.131 --> 00:21:46.758
Mmm.

00:21:46.799 --> 00:21:48.926
Now...

00:21:48.968 --> 00:21:51.994
what do you see in your hands?

00:21:54.307 --> 00:21:58.300
I see... a stone.

00:21:58.344 --> 00:22:01.142
Keep looking.

00:22:05.985 --> 00:22:08.385
Her respiration and pulse
have remained steady.

00:22:08.421 --> 00:22:10.446
But there's been a gradual
buildup of lactic acid

00:22:10.490 --> 00:22:12.617
in her extensor muscles
over the last hour.

00:22:12.659 --> 00:22:14.524
What does that mean?
Is she in danger?

00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:15.584
Not at all.

00:22:15.628 --> 00:22:17.858
She's probably experiencing
light strain.

00:22:17.897 --> 00:22:20.661
What you'd expect
in an endurance ritual.

00:22:22.268 --> 00:22:23.599
Then there's nothing
so far

00:22:23.636 --> 00:22:25.604
that would suggest
a treatment for Kes?

00:22:25.638 --> 00:22:27.401
It's too early to tell.

00:22:27.440 --> 00:22:29.670
I'm downloading
every iota of information

00:22:29.709 --> 00:22:32.303
from the bioprobe sensors
into a physiometric program,

00:22:32.345 --> 00:22:33.903
which is analyzing the data.

00:22:33.947 --> 00:22:35.972
Even the smallest
physiological change

00:22:36.049 --> 00:22:37.414
may prove significant.

00:22:37.450 --> 00:22:39.179
We can't discount anything.

00:22:47.093 --> 00:22:49.186
What do you see now?

00:22:51.664 --> 00:22:55.361
I still see... a stone.

00:23:04.010 --> 00:23:05.272
I guess you're not
going to tell me

00:23:05.311 --> 00:23:06.300
what I'm supposed to draw.

00:23:06.346 --> 00:23:08.405
That would be too easy,
wouldn't it?

00:23:08.448 --> 00:23:10.712
It's up to you...
draw whatever feels right.

00:23:10.750 --> 00:23:12.308
I've never been able to draw.

00:23:12.352 --> 00:23:14.513
My sister was the artist
in the family.

00:23:14.554 --> 00:23:16.044
And you were the scientist.

00:23:16.089 --> 00:23:17.386
It's true.

00:23:17.423 --> 00:23:19.948
When other children
were outside playing games,

00:23:20.026 --> 00:23:22.153
I was doing
mathematics problems.

00:23:22.195 --> 00:23:25.961
Mathematics? I can see
why you enjoyed it.

00:23:26.065 --> 00:23:28.260
Solve a problem, get an answer.

00:23:28.301 --> 00:23:29.962
The answer's either
right or wrong.

00:23:30.003 --> 00:23:31.937
It's very absolute.

00:23:31.971 --> 00:23:33.905
I've always found that
satisfying.

00:23:33.940 --> 00:23:36.272
I'm sure you did.

00:24:16.749 --> 00:24:18.580
What did you see?

00:24:20.286 --> 00:24:22.220
I'm not sure.

00:24:22.255 --> 00:24:23.984
Describe it.

00:24:29.195 --> 00:24:30.321
Aha.

00:24:30.363 --> 00:24:32.126
What?!

00:24:32.165 --> 00:24:33.655
What is it?!

00:24:33.699 --> 00:24:35.291
What have you found?

00:24:35.334 --> 00:24:36.665
There have been
significant increases

00:24:36.702 --> 00:24:38.533
in the Captain's
respiration, neuropeptides

00:24:38.571 --> 00:24:41.096
and adenosine
triphosphate levels.

00:24:41.140 --> 00:24:42.164
Is that bad?

00:24:42.208 --> 00:24:43.573
It certainly suggests
she's going through

00:24:43.609 --> 00:24:45.270
a grueling physical
experience.

00:24:45.311 --> 00:24:47.279
But it's the neuropeptides
that are interesting.

00:24:47.313 --> 00:24:50.077
The saturations have risen
to quite an abnormal level.

00:24:50.116 --> 00:24:52.107
Is that good or bad?

00:24:52.151 --> 00:24:54.278
I can't say it's either, so far
as the Captain is concerned.

00:24:54.320 --> 00:24:55.810
But it certainly seems

00:24:55.855 --> 00:24:57.789
a substantial piece
of information.

00:24:57.824 --> 00:24:59.985
Neuropeptide levels this high

00:25:00.059 --> 00:25:03.426
could well create a natural
barrier to biogenic energy.

00:25:03.463 --> 00:25:06.023
So you have something
that will help Kes.

00:25:06.065 --> 00:25:07.930
Not yet, but it's
the first piece of data

00:25:08.034 --> 00:25:10.298
that allows me even
to formulate a hypothesis.

00:25:10.336 --> 00:25:12.463
It should be me going
through all that.

00:25:12.505 --> 00:25:15.497
I was the one who let Kes
get hurt in the first place.

00:25:15.541 --> 00:25:16.940
Mr. Neelix, you're wallowing.

00:25:16.976 --> 00:25:17.943
I'm...

00:25:17.977 --> 00:25:18.944
Wallowing in useless remorse.

00:25:19.045 --> 00:25:20.069
I'll have to ask you to stop.

00:25:20.113 --> 00:25:21.637
It's bad for the patient.

00:25:21.681 --> 00:25:25.276
It's just frustrating
to be so helpless.

00:25:26.752 --> 00:25:31.951
If it's any consolation,
Mr. Neelix, I do understand.

00:25:37.163 --> 00:25:39.188
I'm exhausted.

00:25:39.232 --> 00:25:40.563
Oh, thank you.

00:25:40.600 --> 00:25:42.795
Your microprobe
should be transmitting

00:25:42.835 --> 00:25:46.066
all kinds of interesting
information back to the ship.

00:25:50.776 --> 00:25:51.868
What is that?

00:25:51.911 --> 00:25:53.936
It's a nesset.

00:25:53.980 --> 00:25:56.471
They're able to travel
from this world

00:25:56.516 --> 00:25:58.347
into the spirit realm.

00:25:58.384 --> 00:26:00.648
They serve as gatekeepers.

00:26:00.686 --> 00:26:02.586
Gatekeepers.

00:26:02.622 --> 00:26:05.386
Then I'm ready to enter
the spirit realm.

00:26:05.424 --> 00:26:07.483
Do you think you're ready?

00:26:10.663 --> 00:26:12.790
Yes, I do.

00:26:12.832 --> 00:26:14.732
Then you are.

00:26:14.767 --> 00:26:18.396
Go ahead.
Put your hand in.

00:26:33.619 --> 00:26:35.678
We can stop right now
if you like.

00:26:35.721 --> 00:26:37.245
No, I'm not quitting.

00:26:53.506 --> 00:26:54.871
Don't be afraid.

00:26:54.907 --> 00:26:57.398
Oh... it's burning me!

00:26:57.443 --> 00:26:58.410
Oh, my chest!

00:26:58.444 --> 00:27:00.207
Getting tight!

00:27:00.246 --> 00:27:03.215
Oh, oh, oh...

00:27:14.227 --> 00:27:15.558
Captain?

00:27:16.896 --> 00:27:18.830
Captain?

00:27:18.864 --> 00:27:21.424
Kathryn?

00:27:21.467 --> 00:27:23.935
I'm dying.

00:27:23.970 --> 00:27:26.302
Everyone dies eventually.

00:27:34.513 --> 00:27:36.913
It's been three days
since she had any sleep.

00:27:36.949 --> 00:27:38.746
How long are we going
to let her go through this?

00:27:38.784 --> 00:27:40.251
I understand your concern,
Commander,

00:27:40.286 --> 00:27:43.084
but I must point out
that her vital signs are stable.

00:27:43.122 --> 00:27:44.851
She seems to be
in no immediate danger.

00:27:44.890 --> 00:27:47.085
She's been poisoned
with some unknown toxin.

00:27:47.126 --> 00:27:49.390
It may be having an effect
we can't gauge.

00:27:49.428 --> 00:27:50.861
It could lie dormant
for a few days

00:27:50.896 --> 00:27:52.625
and then suddenly fluctuate
and kill her in minutes.

00:27:52.665 --> 00:27:55.930
You seem to be implying that
I'm not paying attention.

00:27:55.968 --> 00:27:57.959
I assure you, I am
monitoring her constantly.

00:27:58.004 --> 00:27:59.801
If I thought she were
in jeopardy, I would act.

00:27:59.839 --> 00:28:02.273
Doctor, is there anything
which might be preventing her

00:28:02.308 --> 00:28:04.208
from using the homing signal
in her implant?

00:28:04.243 --> 00:28:05.301
Not that I'm aware of.

00:28:05.344 --> 00:28:07.312
She's fully conscious
and has complete motor control.

00:28:07.346 --> 00:28:09.473
If she wanted to transport,
she could signal us.

00:28:09.515 --> 00:28:11.142
Are you getting enough
meaningful information

00:28:11.183 --> 00:28:13.378
to justify
her continuing this ordeal?

00:28:13.419 --> 00:28:15.410
I am getting
some remarkable data.

00:28:15.454 --> 00:28:17.513
Her entire biochemistry

00:28:17.556 --> 00:28:20.923
is undergoing a series
of unique interactions. Look.

00:28:20.960 --> 00:28:23.929
This amino acid has been formed
as a result of the breakdown

00:28:24.030 --> 00:28:25.463
of the toxin in her bloodstream.

00:28:25.498 --> 00:28:28.058
It's affecting the normal flow
of neurotransmitters

00:28:28.100 --> 00:28:30.364
and very likely having
a hallucinogenic effect.

00:28:30.403 --> 00:28:31.603
Is she delusional?

00:28:31.736 --> 00:28:33.533
I think she's experiencing
the Nechani version

00:28:33.571 --> 00:28:34.697
of a psychoactive drug.

00:28:34.739 --> 00:28:36.604
Then is it possible
she's in no condition

00:28:36.641 --> 00:28:37.938
to activate the homing signal?

00:28:38.042 --> 00:28:39.634
I don't believe that's the case

00:28:39.677 --> 00:28:41.577
and I strongly suspect
this biochemical change

00:28:41.613 --> 00:28:43.843
is going to give us
the answers we need.

00:28:43.881 --> 00:28:45.712
The toxin in her bloodstream

00:28:45.750 --> 00:28:48.275
may very well be the key
to creating a treatment for Kes.

00:28:48.319 --> 00:28:51.516
Commander, the decision
is ultimately yours, of course.

00:28:51.556 --> 00:28:53.956
However, I believe it would be
the Captain's desire

00:28:54.058 --> 00:28:55.525
to complete the ritual.

00:28:58.096 --> 00:29:00.326
All right. We'll leave
her there for now.

00:29:00.365 --> 00:29:03.528
But I'm not moving from this
monitor until she gets back.

00:29:15.179 --> 00:29:16.407
Oh.

00:29:31.362 --> 00:29:33.353
What is this?

00:29:34.832 --> 00:29:36.823
An hallucination?

00:29:36.868 --> 00:29:40.031
I'm only here
to serve as a voice...

00:29:40.071 --> 00:29:43.632
an interpreter
for the Ancestral Spirits.

00:29:43.675 --> 00:29:45.643
I see.

00:29:45.677 --> 00:29:51.946
If there are other beings here,
could I see them myself?

00:29:51.983 --> 00:29:55.384
You mean you want proof
that we exist?

00:29:55.420 --> 00:29:57.217
That would be helpful.

00:29:57.255 --> 00:29:58.950
It's irrelevant.

00:30:00.525 --> 00:30:03.289
I don't want to be
disrespectful.

00:30:03.327 --> 00:30:05.727
I have gone through
every part of the ritual

00:30:05.763 --> 00:30:08.197
that I have been asked to.

00:30:08.232 --> 00:30:10.530
Everything you've gone through
is meaningless.

00:30:10.568 --> 00:30:11.694
You've been told that.

00:30:11.736 --> 00:30:13.931
I know.

00:30:15.573 --> 00:30:19.202
I just want to bring this
to completion...

00:30:19.243 --> 00:30:21.336
to make my request.

00:30:21.379 --> 00:30:23.244
Then, by all means, do so.

00:30:30.121 --> 00:30:34.319
I cite the story
of King Nevad as precedent.

00:30:35.526 --> 00:30:38.791
In the same way
he pleaded for his son,

00:30:38.830 --> 00:30:43.426
I ask that Kes
be restored to health.

00:30:43.468 --> 00:30:47.268
Your request is inconsequential.

00:30:47.305 --> 00:30:49.899
You have what you need
to save her yourself.

00:30:56.314 --> 00:30:57.747
Welcome back.

00:31:00.051 --> 00:31:01.951
How long?

00:31:02.019 --> 00:31:03.247
Does that matter?

00:31:03.287 --> 00:31:04.311
Oh...

00:31:04.355 --> 00:31:05.947
I'd like to know.

00:31:05.990 --> 00:31:08.049
39 hours.

00:31:08.092 --> 00:31:09.855
You must take care
of yourself.

00:31:09.894 --> 00:31:10.883
Your body's weak.

00:31:10.928 --> 00:31:13.556
I guess the physical
conditioning programs

00:31:13.598 --> 00:31:16.726
on the holodeck didn't
quite prepare me for this.

00:31:16.768 --> 00:31:19.236
Has it been worthwhile?

00:31:19.270 --> 00:31:21.204
I think so.

00:31:23.508 --> 00:31:27.706
I was told that I had
what I needed to save Kes.

00:31:27.745 --> 00:31:29.440
Then it must be true.

00:31:29.480 --> 00:31:33.075
The Spirits would not
deceive you.

00:31:38.523 --> 00:31:39.990
Whenever you're ready.

00:31:48.466 --> 00:31:49.933
Thank you.

00:32:03.748 --> 00:32:06.308
You could use a good night's
sleep and a solid meal,

00:32:06.350 --> 00:32:09.410
but otherwise,
you're in good shape.

00:32:09.453 --> 00:32:11.444
When can you begin treating Kes?

00:32:11.489 --> 00:32:12.547
Right away.

00:32:12.590 --> 00:32:15.354
The ritual may have been arduous
for you, Captain,

00:32:15.393 --> 00:32:17.554
but it was certainly worthwhile.

00:32:17.595 --> 00:32:19.563
As I suspected,
the toxin was the key.

00:32:19.597 --> 00:32:21.497
That's what produces
the natural immunity

00:32:21.532 --> 00:32:22.556
the Nechani monks acquire

00:32:22.600 --> 00:32:24.158
before they enter
the biogenic field.

00:32:24.202 --> 00:32:26.693
How does that translate
into a cure for Kes?

00:32:26.737 --> 00:32:28.762
I've created
a physiometric program

00:32:28.806 --> 00:32:32.902
to analyze the immune mechanism
and develop a treatment regimen.

00:32:32.944 --> 00:32:34.138
Then let's get started.

00:32:34.178 --> 00:32:35.975
Captain, if you'll excuse me.

00:32:36.080 --> 00:32:38.105
I'm probably more useful
on the Bridge right now.

00:32:48.326 --> 00:32:51.159
I'll carry out
the treatment in stages

00:32:51.195 --> 00:32:53.595
to reduce the physical stress
from the metabolic changes.

00:32:55.900 --> 00:32:57.265
What's that?
Is something wrong?

00:32:57.301 --> 00:32:58.325
I don't believe so.

00:32:59.704 --> 00:33:02.605
Hmm. Her electrolyte balance
is deviating,

00:33:02.640 --> 00:33:05.302
but that's not entirely
unexpected.

00:33:05.343 --> 00:33:06.367
It isn't.

00:33:06.410 --> 00:33:07.570
Hmm...

00:33:07.612 --> 00:33:09.637
What does that mean...
"hmm" what?

00:33:09.680 --> 00:33:12.240
Mr. Neelix, if you keep on
pestering me with questions,

00:33:12.283 --> 00:33:14.251
I won't be able to concentrate
on what I'm doing.

00:33:17.555 --> 00:33:19.079
Something is wrong.

00:33:20.858 --> 00:33:22.291
What is it, Doctor?

00:33:23.728 --> 00:33:25.958
Her cardiac functions
are being disrupted.

00:33:26.030 --> 00:33:27.725
I don't understand it.

00:33:30.434 --> 00:33:33.426
Lectrazine should counteract
the disruptions.

00:33:35.940 --> 00:33:37.373
This is baffling.

00:33:37.408 --> 00:33:39.842
Her biochemical levels
are exactly what they need to be

00:33:39.877 --> 00:33:41.276
to correct the damage.

00:33:41.312 --> 00:33:42.643
She should be awake and alert.

00:33:42.680 --> 00:33:43.874
Then why isn't she?!

00:33:43.915 --> 00:33:45.280
I can't explain it.

00:33:45.316 --> 00:33:46.715
Her vital signs are unstable.

00:33:46.751 --> 00:33:49.311
I have to discontinue treatment.

00:33:52.924 --> 00:33:54.551
I don't understand it.

00:33:56.560 --> 00:33:58.619
Can't we try again?

00:33:58.663 --> 00:33:59.630
It's too dangerous.

00:33:59.664 --> 00:34:00.926
Do you have any other options?

00:34:00.965 --> 00:34:01.932
No.

00:34:01.966 --> 00:34:04.457
I'm sorry, Captain,

00:34:04.502 --> 00:34:07.869
but it appears that everything
you went through...

00:34:07.905 --> 00:34:09.236
was meaningless.

00:34:27.358 --> 00:34:29.656
You meant what you
said, didn't you?

00:34:29.694 --> 00:34:32.219
Everything I went
through was meaningless.

00:34:32.263 --> 00:34:33.423
Yes.

00:34:33.464 --> 00:34:36.763
I did everything
you asked of me.

00:34:36.801 --> 00:34:39.599
You led me to believe that
would allow me to help Kes.

00:34:39.637 --> 00:34:42.162
I haven't led you anywhere,
Kathryn.

00:34:42.206 --> 00:34:44.970
You've taken me along
wherever you wanted to go.

00:34:45.042 --> 00:34:46.600
This was your ritual.

00:34:46.644 --> 00:34:49.704
You set these challenges
for yourself.

00:34:49.747 --> 00:34:53.239
It's true that I came here
with certain expectations...

00:34:56.354 --> 00:34:59.221
Are you saying
that you simply...

00:34:59.256 --> 00:35:02.089
fulfilled my expectations?

00:35:02.126 --> 00:35:05.152
You'd have settled
for nothing else.

00:35:05.196 --> 00:35:07.892
I'm not ready to give up.

00:35:07.932 --> 00:35:11.925
If there's still a way
to save Kes, I want to try.

00:35:11.969 --> 00:35:14.529
You've come back
to seek the Spirits.

00:35:16.841 --> 00:35:19.207
I don't know what I'm seeking.

00:35:20.778 --> 00:35:23.941
Then I believe
you are ready to begin.

00:35:32.356 --> 00:35:35.689
Well. Look who's come back.

00:35:43.534 --> 00:35:46.799
So, your little adventure
didn't quite work out

00:35:46.837 --> 00:35:47.963
the way you'd planned it.

00:35:48.039 --> 00:35:50.269
You put yourself through
a lot of trouble

00:35:50.307 --> 00:35:52.468
and for nothing, didn't you?

00:35:52.510 --> 00:35:54.444
Don't feel bad.

00:35:54.478 --> 00:35:56.469
You wouldn't believe
some of the things

00:35:56.514 --> 00:35:58.175
people have done to themselves

00:35:58.215 --> 00:35:59.978
on their way
to seek the Spirits.

00:36:00.084 --> 00:36:02.917
So there's no real ritual
after all.

00:36:03.020 --> 00:36:05.011
"Real" is such a relative term.

00:36:05.056 --> 00:36:06.785
Most of the challenges in life

00:36:06.824 --> 00:36:08.917
are the ones we create
for ourselves.

00:36:08.959 --> 00:36:13.225
And you are particularly hard
on yourself, aren't you?

00:36:13.264 --> 00:36:16.461
I've always been driven
to succeed.

00:36:16.500 --> 00:36:19.060
Stubborn, I'd say.

00:36:19.103 --> 00:36:20.798
You didn't really consider

00:36:20.838 --> 00:36:22.863
sitting and waiting
with us, did you?

00:36:22.907 --> 00:36:26.206
Well, I'm here now,
and I'm asking for your help.

00:36:26.243 --> 00:36:28.336
I want to understand the purpose

00:36:28.379 --> 00:36:31.473
of waiting in this room.

00:36:31.515 --> 00:36:34.746
But isn't it enough
to sit and be sociable?

00:36:34.785 --> 00:36:37.120
We're good company.

00:36:37.253 --> 00:36:39.915
That's what I'm supposed to do...

00:36:39.956 --> 00:36:42.891
talk to the Ancestral Spirits.

00:36:42.925 --> 00:36:43.892
Oh...

00:36:43.926 --> 00:36:45.723
first, we were a test,

00:36:45.761 --> 00:36:48.753
and now we're
the Ancestral Spirits.

00:36:50.333 --> 00:36:51.698
Are you?

00:36:51.734 --> 00:36:54.703
That would be nice
and quantifiable for you,

00:36:54.737 --> 00:36:56.432
wouldn't it?

00:36:56.472 --> 00:36:58.133
If the Spirits were something

00:36:58.174 --> 00:37:00.369
that you could see
and touch and scan

00:37:00.409 --> 00:37:02.206
with your little devices.

00:37:02.245 --> 00:37:04.042
If you can explain everything,

00:37:04.080 --> 00:37:06.241
what's left to believe in?

00:37:07.550 --> 00:37:10.075
I know it's an important part
of your religion

00:37:10.119 --> 00:37:12.246
to trust the Spirits
without question,

00:37:12.288 --> 00:37:14.620
but I wasn't brought up
that way.

00:37:14.657 --> 00:37:16.625
It's hard for me to accept.

00:37:16.659 --> 00:37:21.028
So much for your tolerant,
open-minded Starfleet ideals.

00:37:21.063 --> 00:37:22.428
There's a difference
between respecting

00:37:22.465 --> 00:37:24.933
the spiritual beliefs
of other cultures

00:37:25.001 --> 00:37:26.696
and embracing them myself.

00:37:26.736 --> 00:37:28.135
Fine. Don't embrace a thing.

00:37:28.171 --> 00:37:29.365
It's all the same to us.

00:37:29.405 --> 00:37:30.770
Go on back to your ship

00:37:30.806 --> 00:37:33.434
and play with your
molecular microscanner.

00:37:33.476 --> 00:37:36.172
You've tried all that already,

00:37:36.212 --> 00:37:38.840
but it didn't work, did it?

00:37:38.881 --> 00:37:40.610
Kes didn't get better.

00:37:40.650 --> 00:37:41.947
No, she didn't.

00:37:42.018 --> 00:37:42.950
Why not?

00:37:43.019 --> 00:37:44.884
The Doctor couldn't explain it.

00:37:44.921 --> 00:37:46.889
So it's inexplicable.

00:37:46.923 --> 00:37:49.619
A miraculous nonrecovery.

00:37:49.659 --> 00:37:51.752
We haven't found the reason yet.

00:37:51.794 --> 00:37:53.489
But of course you will.

00:37:53.529 --> 00:37:57.863
You'll find
all the answers eventually

00:37:57.900 --> 00:38:02.894
with enough time and study
and the right sort of tools.

00:38:03.005 --> 00:38:05.906
That's what you believe,
isn't it, as a scientist?

00:38:05.975 --> 00:38:07.772
Be honest.

00:38:10.079 --> 00:38:12.343
Yes, that's what
I've always believed.

00:38:12.381 --> 00:38:15.407
Even when her science fails
right before her eyes,

00:38:15.451 --> 00:38:17.646
she still has
full confidence in it.

00:38:17.687 --> 00:38:20.656
Now there's a leap of faith.

00:38:20.690 --> 00:38:22.920
Unconditional trust.

00:38:23.025 --> 00:38:24.617
Now that's promising.

00:38:24.660 --> 00:38:26.355
All right...

00:38:26.395 --> 00:38:31.389
if you're saying that science
won't help Kes, what will?

00:38:31.434 --> 00:38:32.594
You won't like it.

00:38:32.635 --> 00:38:35.661
I'm willing to do
whatever's necessary.

00:38:35.705 --> 00:38:38.037
Kill her.

00:38:38.074 --> 00:38:40.804
She's as good as dead already.

00:38:40.843 --> 00:38:42.367
Finish the job.

00:38:42.411 --> 00:38:44.311
Give her another jolt of that...

00:38:44.347 --> 00:38:45.609
what do you call it?...

00:38:45.648 --> 00:38:46.945
biogenic field.

00:38:47.016 --> 00:38:49.246
Oh... that would do it.

00:38:49.285 --> 00:38:52.118
It would do what exactly?

00:38:52.154 --> 00:38:53.382
There you go again.

00:38:53.422 --> 00:38:56.084
Always looking
for a rational explanation.

00:38:56.125 --> 00:38:57.592
Well, there isn't one.

00:38:57.627 --> 00:39:00.926
Your orbital scans
and medical research

00:39:00.963 --> 00:39:03.158
have given you the facts...

00:39:03.199 --> 00:39:08.466
and they tell you
the biogenic field is lethal.

00:39:08.504 --> 00:39:10.199
If you believe the facts.

00:39:10.239 --> 00:39:12.901
Let all of that go, Kathryn.

00:39:13.009 --> 00:39:15.807
Take Kes back into the shrine

00:39:15.845 --> 00:39:18.780
and trust the Spirits
to return her soul.

00:39:21.717 --> 00:39:25.175
The ritual I went through
was meaningless...

00:39:25.221 --> 00:39:27.553
and Kes has done nothing
to prepare herself.

00:39:27.590 --> 00:39:30.650
How could either of us be ready
to go through the field?

00:39:30.693 --> 00:39:34.595
If you believe you're ready,
then you are.

00:39:34.630 --> 00:39:37.929
There's no more to it than that.

00:39:37.967 --> 00:39:43.496
But if you go in with any doubt,
with any hesitation,

00:39:43.539 --> 00:39:45.666
then you're both dead.

00:39:46.976 --> 00:39:48.170
So...

00:39:48.210 --> 00:39:51.646
what are you going to do...
Captain?

00:39:51.681 --> 00:39:55.412
You know I won't stand by
and watch Kes die

00:39:55.451 --> 00:39:57.783
if there's anything I can do
to save her.

00:39:59.789 --> 00:40:02.519
I want to believe it's possible.

00:40:06.495 --> 00:40:08.486
I'm going to try.

00:40:12.301 --> 00:40:13.734
Janeway to Chakotay.

00:40:13.769 --> 00:40:15.760
Captain, we've been worried
about you.

00:40:15.805 --> 00:40:17.170
I'm all right.

00:40:17.206 --> 00:40:19.970
I want you to beam Kes down here
to the sanctuary.

00:40:20.076 --> 00:40:22.340
Acknowledged.
I'll bring her down myself.

00:40:22.378 --> 00:40:23.743
Chakotay to Sick Bay.

00:40:23.779 --> 00:40:25.542
Doctor, prepare Kes
for transport.

00:40:25.581 --> 00:40:26.912
Understood.

00:40:41.564 --> 00:40:44.328
The Doctor says her life signs
are deteriorating.

00:40:44.367 --> 00:40:46.562
He almost wouldn't let us
take her out of Sick Bay.

00:40:46.602 --> 00:40:47.899
You've found a way to help her.

00:40:47.937 --> 00:40:48.995
Yes, I have.

00:40:49.038 --> 00:40:52.007
I'm taking her back
into the biogenic field.

00:40:52.041 --> 00:40:55.306
I hate to question you, Captain,
but why?

00:40:55.344 --> 00:40:57.938
I believe it will save her life.

00:40:57.980 --> 00:41:00.608
You have some new information
on the effects of the field?

00:41:00.649 --> 00:41:02.810
I can't explain it to you.

00:41:02.852 --> 00:41:07.721
Captain... you've been through
a lot in the past few days.

00:41:07.757 --> 00:41:08.724
I know what I'm doing.

00:41:08.758 --> 00:41:10.919
Are you sure of that?

00:41:10.960 --> 00:41:14.452
There are 800 megajoules
of biogenic energy running

00:41:14.497 --> 00:41:15.691
through that shrine.

00:41:15.731 --> 00:41:18.359
The thoron radiation levels
are off the scale.

00:41:18.401 --> 00:41:20.528
That's what you'd be taking
her and yourself into.

00:41:21.570 --> 00:41:23.697
Why don't you take some
time to think about this

00:41:23.739 --> 00:41:25.570
and let us run a few more scans?

00:41:25.608 --> 00:41:28.133
No.

00:41:28.177 --> 00:41:30.975
Captain...

00:41:31.013 --> 00:41:32.742
this isn't like you.

00:41:32.782 --> 00:41:35.216
You know you'll always have
my gratitude

00:41:35.251 --> 00:41:37.185
for everything you've done
to save Kes,

00:41:37.219 --> 00:41:40.154
but I couldn't...
and I know she couldn't...

00:41:40.189 --> 00:41:42.453
ask you to risk your own life
like this.

00:41:42.491 --> 00:41:44.482
There are too many other people
who need you.

00:41:44.527 --> 00:41:46.222
He's right.

00:41:46.262 --> 00:41:48.492
It's my responsibility
to keep you safe...

00:41:48.531 --> 00:41:50.590
for the crew's sake,
if not for your own.

00:41:50.633 --> 00:41:52.965
I'd rather not have
to relieve you of duty,

00:41:53.002 --> 00:41:55.163
but if your judgment's
been impaired in any way...

00:41:55.204 --> 00:41:57.729
He can't really do that, can he?

00:41:57.773 --> 00:41:59.764
Yes, he can.

00:42:01.010 --> 00:42:03.137
I suppose it might be necessary

00:42:03.179 --> 00:42:05.943
if the Captain of a ship
were really mentally impaired,

00:42:05.981 --> 00:42:08.677
but you're not crazy, Kathryn.

00:42:08.717 --> 00:42:10.150
You know that.

00:42:10.186 --> 00:42:12.654
These are the same people
who were willing

00:42:12.688 --> 00:42:15.714
to let Kes die just for
disturbing their shrine.

00:42:15.758 --> 00:42:19.785
Can you take their word for it
that you'll be safe in there?

00:42:19.829 --> 00:42:21.820
I can't give you
my word on that.

00:42:21.864 --> 00:42:24.264
Nobody knows what
will happen to them

00:42:24.300 --> 00:42:26.791
in the shrine until they go in.

00:42:26.836 --> 00:42:29.396
I don't know the answers...

00:42:29.438 --> 00:42:31.406
but you do.

00:42:41.650 --> 00:42:43.743
Captain...

00:42:43.786 --> 00:42:45.720
I don't understand this.

00:42:45.754 --> 00:42:47.984
Neither do I.

00:42:48.023 --> 00:42:50.787
That's the challenge.

00:43:40.609 --> 00:43:41.735
Kes...

00:43:49.618 --> 00:43:52.587
The tricorder readings Commander
Chakotay took at the shrine

00:43:52.621 --> 00:43:54.350
reveal traces of iridium ions,

00:43:54.390 --> 00:43:55.652
which we could've
known about sooner

00:43:55.691 --> 00:43:58.125
if we'd been permitted
to take those readings at first.

00:43:58.160 --> 00:43:59.957
And iridium ions
are significant?

00:43:59.995 --> 00:44:02.486
They caused a temporary
dielectric effect

00:44:02.531 --> 00:44:04.123
in the outer epidermal layers,

00:44:04.166 --> 00:44:06.259
which neutralized
some of the biogenic energy...

00:44:06.302 --> 00:44:09.601
not much, but enough to make the
Captain's altered biochemistry

00:44:09.638 --> 00:44:10.935
an effective defense.

00:44:11.006 --> 00:44:12.405
Then how was I cured?

00:44:12.441 --> 00:44:13.874
The metabolic treatment
I administered

00:44:13.909 --> 00:44:15.342
protected you
against the full impact

00:44:15.377 --> 00:44:16.901
of exposure to the field

00:44:16.946 --> 00:44:18.641
when the Captain
took you through.

00:44:18.681 --> 00:44:22.549
That exposure functioned like
a natural cortical stimulator

00:44:22.585 --> 00:44:25.383
and reactivated
your synaptic pathways.

00:44:25.421 --> 00:44:27.116
That's fascinating, Doctor.

00:44:28.891 --> 00:44:30.358
Captain?

00:44:32.294 --> 00:44:34.319
If there's something
about my analysis

00:44:34.363 --> 00:44:35.489
you disagree with...

00:44:35.531 --> 00:44:38.796
It's a perfectly sound
explanation, Doctor.

00:44:38.834 --> 00:44:42.895
Very... scientific.
